      "writtenOn": "2021-07-21T19:19:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has not yet been used in AF, and just our GMs for testing. Now that I\u0027ve worked out the rough draft of the change in Android, ResetClip() that always makes the clip state entirely wide open or equal to the device clip restriction is minimally sufficient. \n\nIt also looks like in the short term that the device clip restriction will remain tracked within skia, so Android wont\u0027 need the function variant that passes in the specific rectangle. If we get to that point down the road, it\u0027s easy enough to expand this API.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 47,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 47,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "c9b184faf50c6b04dc00847fdcce57dae4774f57",
