        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-21T19:19:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I opted to model this more closely after onDoSaveBehind() where the base SkCanvas still has most of the logic in its non-virtual, vs. the core clipping/drawing commands where almost everything is in the onX virtuals.\n\nI don\u0027t feel too strongly about moving to just a virtual onResetClip() with the expectation that recording canvases have to call the super method in order to have the reset clip reflected in the base canvas state.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2201,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 2202,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "c9b184faf50c6b04dc00847fdcce57dae4774f57",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
